    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "**Goal:** Use the Prompt Helper to fix one problem you found when you tested your Who Am AI? game.\r\n\r\n1. Copy the text from your **set my_prompt** block and paste it in the chat.\r\n2. Tell the helper one problem from your test table. For example: \"My robot said its job.\"\r\n3. Read the helper's idea. Ask yourself: why would this line change what the AI does?\r\n4. In the **AI Helper Log** in your project guide, write the idea, why it would change the AI, and your choice: **Accept**, **Revise**, or **Reject**. Give a reason.\r\n5. Go back to your game and test the idea. Write what happened.\r\n\r\n**Try asking:**\r\n- \"My robot keeps saying its job. How do I stop it?\"\r\n- \"My hints are too easy. What should I add to my prompt?\"\r\n- \"When I type my guess, the AI says Not sure a lot. Why?\"\r\n\r\nThe helper gives you one idea at a time. It will not write your whole prompt. AI can be wrong, so test its ideas in your game. If you see a message that your chat was flagged, ask your question in a different way.",
